    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I view mathematics as a structured but challenging subject. I find it logical and useful, especially in chemistry and economics, but I don’t feel deeply connected to it like I do with nature or music. My parents’ background—especially my dad’s PhD—gave me some confidence, but I still struggle with abstract concepts. I approach it with patience and curiosity, not fear.",
